    "Name": "Dig Lord RCL-Z1",
    "Details": "Developed in 3057, the 65 ton Dig Lord Industrial Mech is a heavier version of the older Dig King. The RCL-Z1 ‘‘Deep Lord’’ is a custom modified variant of the Dig Lord used exclusively by the Calderon Protectorate as a Militia Mech. Powered by a 195-rated Fuel Cell, the Mech is armed with a turret mounted Heavy Rifle and an MML-5. A Vibroblade with an Actuator Enhancement System gives the Mech some close combat capabilities.\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Quirk: Improved Lifesupport</color></b>\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Drop Cost Multiplier: 0.82</color></b>",
